Lock the door: 

As a user of the CoolManager system,
I want to be able to lock the refrigerator door,
So that I can prevent accidental openings, especially in households with small children.
Furthermore, if the refrigerator has a door lock function,
I expect the CoolManager system to provide a user-friendly interface to activate and deactivate this function as needed,
And I anticipate receiving visual confirmations or alerts to ensure that the door is securely locked and to notify me of any attempts to open the locked door.

If the refrigerator has a door lock function, the user should be able to activate this function to prevent accidental opening, for example, in the case of having small children at home.
